1: <!doctype html>
2: <html lang="en">
3: <head>
4: <meta charset="utf-8">
5: <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
6: <meta name="theme-color" content="#101114">
7: <title>THE HOUSE BETWEEN — a psychological horror story</title>
8: <style>
